# Hushbringer: "Creatures ... dying don't cause abilities to trigger" (CR 603.2, 700.4). Bot2's Bitter Triumph destroys
# Bot1's Worldspine Wurm while Bot2's Hushbringer is on the battlefield: "When this creature dies, create three 5/5 Wurm
# tokens" does not trigger, so no Wurms. The Wurm's other ability, "When Worldspine Wurm is put into a graveyard from
# anywhere, shuffle it into its owner's library", is the dying card's own and still triggers (the rulings: "It will
# trigger if the ability is of a dying creature that triggers only when that creature is put into a graveyard from
# anywhere"): the card goes back into the library, which grows by one (Worldspine Wurm's Wrath of God game is the control).

